                                "sense_id": "071fe91c-6412-3cfe-be12-ccefab6fc20a",
                                "text": "When your worship's pleas'd to correctify a lady."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e49b351-d695-4cee-9c4d-35e0aa9902f3",
                                "sense_id": "071fe91c-6412-3cfe-be12-ccefab6fc20a",
                                "text": "I've correctified the minutes of Secretary Stiles, and send it to you to publish, to let our Democratic brethren, all over the country, know that we've made a rally here to try to save the party[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "83533f72-61ab-4c90-9f3a-4085a9a1f5ec",
                                "sense_id": "071fe91c-6412-3cfe-be12-ccefab6fc20a",
                                "text": "\"You're a demolisher?\" \"Apprentice!\" replied Xavier enthusiastically, holding up a correctifying finger."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c10627cc-c933-4561-a81e-03e0f5eb3bd0",
                                "sense_id": "071fe91c-6412-3cfe-be12-ccefab6fc20a",
                                "text": "They recognized Him being that they approached Him but he correctified them. That's what the Bible was saying and you got to believe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
